these recipes on the go,

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.740
tag me @Weelicious, #DrewBarrymoreShow.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.484
Thanks for having me,
Drew, this was so much fun.

00:07:30.484 --> 00:07:33.734
